Package: mztabm
Title: Read, Validate, Convert and Inspect 'mzTab-M' Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adriano", "Rutz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "adafede@gmail.com")
Description: Validation, canonical formatting, TSV and JSON conversion and
    summaries of 'mzTab-M' metabolomics result files, through the 'Rust'
    library 'mztab-m': the same reader, validator and writer as the
    'mztab-m' command line tool.
